{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/extras/d9132e83e8002fbcae5c38617f63f02a.poster.avif?t=1771852096\" width=540 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/extras/d9132e83e8002fbcae5c38617f63f02a.webm?t=1771852096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/extras/d9132e83e8002fbcae5c38617f63f02a.mp4?t=1771852096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hyperflex ULTRA is an ultra fast-paced, ultra challenging ultra action game that will seriously test your reflexes and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FLEX through twisting tunnels, dodge deadly obstacles, switch gravity in ways you never even thought possible and see just how hard you can FLEX in this endless runner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/extras/870a04652fe56726ff639dffaf390e7e.poster.avif?t=1771852096\" width=540 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/extras/870a04652fe56726ff639dffaf390e7e.webm?t=1771852096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/extras/870a04652fe56726ff639dffaf390e7e.mp4?t=1771852096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 procedurally generated levels, each with its own unique twist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Groovy original chiptune soundtrack by Purely Grey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of unlockables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A caring [REDACTED] that watches your every move. Wait, what!?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember, true mastery of FLEXING means gliding through each level like it's second nature \u2013 or in other words, VIBING. Think you've got what it takes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/extras/c76c410030a4dff85d635cc8c6aa43bd.poster.avif?t=1771852096\" width=540 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/extras/c76c410030a4dff85d635cc8c6aa43bd.webm?t=1771852096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/extras/c76c410030a4dff85d635cc8c6aa43bd.mp4?t=1771852096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3688000?t=1771852096","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3688000?t=1771852096","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/f09243444888f5bfe0857086d733ff02528bf33a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771852096","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/f09243444888f5bfe0857086d733ff02528bf33a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771852096","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Touch Only Optio